1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,540
It's only a simple check, just some lab work, nothing more

2
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:12,500
But the second I smell that hallway, it comes knocking at the door

3
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:18,180
My heart picks up the pace, and my fingertips go numb

4
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:25,460
Like my body knows this building, and it's bracing for what's to come

5
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:31,140
Cold sweat down my neck, and my throat is turning dry

6
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:37,700
The walls start closing in, and I couldn't tell you why

7
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:41,220
They say the scans are looking clean, but my body won't believe it

8
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:49,540
'Cause the last time they said nothing's wrong, it was there, and I could feel it

9
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:55,300
The battle's over, but the alarm's still on

10
00:00:56,500 --> 00:01:02,660
Four years clear, and it's ringing just as strong
